<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITI Technologies raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITI Technologies raised.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson Stephens &amp; Co said analyst Steve DeLuca raised his rating on ITI Technologies to long-term attractive from market performer.</p>
<p>- DeLuca cited recent announcement of an agreement to develop a custom wireless system for Wester, the third largest security alarm monitoring service in the U.S.</p>
<p>- DeLuca raised his earnings per share estimate for fiscal 1997 to $1.38 a share from $1.34, and for fiscal 1998 to $1.57 from $1.30.</p>
</text>
